        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Two Players. One Massive Stone. The Ultimate Co-op Test.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pyramidion is a punishing yet rewarding <strong>physics-based climbing game</strong> built entirely on <strong>teamwork</strong>. You and a friend must haul a colossal stone block from the base to the summit of a monolith. Forget playing solo. It's just you, your partner, and <strong>unforgiving gravity</strong>.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>True Co-op: Sync or Sink</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communication isn't just helpful; it's mandatory. One player brings the muscle, the other clears the path. If you aren't moving as one, you aren't moving up.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>The Worker:</strong> Brute force. Pushes, pulls, and desperately holds the line.<br></li><li><strong>The Foreman:</strong> Precision. Guides the block, boosts momentum, and clears obstacles.</li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/0cc5676cd15b978b7a6d93dca825e5f9.poster.avif?t=1785879269\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/0cc5676cd15b978b7a6d93dca825e5f9.webm?t=1785879269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/0cc5676cd15b978b7a6d93dca825e5f9.mp4?t=1785879269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Uncompromising Physics</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every ounce of the stone's weight feels real. Momentum is a double-edged sword. A single slip, a mistimed push, or a bad angle can erase minutes of hard work. It’s a <strong>brutal game</strong>, but an honest one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/ed97a3e5fc1e1ec38c0ea6d9b52d8116.poster.avif?t=1785879269\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/ed97a3e5fc1e1ec38c0ea6d9b52d8116.webm?t=1785879269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/ed97a3e5fc1e1ec38c0ea6d9b52d8116.mp4?t=1785879269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Fall, Recover, Conquer</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failure is guaranteed. <strong>Checkpoints</strong> ensure a mistake isn't the end of the world, but you still have to earn every inch. You will fall, you will argue, and you will try again.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Strategic checkpoints to save your sanity.<br></li><li>Every retry sharpens your <strong>teamwork</strong> and timing.</li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/61286b6ae401bfbccf13bdfed40731a3.poster.avif?t=1785879269\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/61286b6ae401bfbccf13bdfed40731a3.webm?t=1785879269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/61286b6ae401bfbccf13bdfed40731a3.mp4?t=1785879269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>The Summit Awaits</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reaching the top requires patience, strategy, and moving as a single unit under pressure. Grab a friend, trust each other, and whatever you do: <strong>don't let go of the stone.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/e0a830c0ebf534a82721d10abf80c036.poster.avif?t=1785879269\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/e0a830c0ebf534a82721d10abf80c036.webm?t=1785879269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/e0a830c0ebf534a82721d10abf80c036.mp4?t=1785879269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p>",
