egy, and moving as a single unit under pressure. Grab a friend, trust each other, and whatever you do: <strong>don't let go of the stone.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/e0a830c0ebf534a82721d10abf80c036.poster.avif?t=1785879269\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/e0a830c0ebf534a82721d10abf80c036.webm?t=1785879269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4024600/extras/e0a830c0ebf534a82721d10abf80c036.mp4?t=1785879269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p>",
